Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..X44z2vPCWqP34ciPYEbXiBeEGBeZ_3yfLkPGvefUNrc

# sau khi event-manager submit --> chuyển qua admin để chấp nhận hoặc từ chối
### Approve event (ADMIN)
### status: APPROVED
### Authorization: Bearer <admin access token>
POST http://localhost:8000/events/693a2f11ba5788d2304a8568/approve
